                                                "sense_id": "19a56b53-e9fe-3054-8e51-03498803d31a",
                                                "text": "In the late stages of the Green Bay Packers’ snowswept 42-20 playoff victory over Seattle on Saturday, Brett Favre and Donald Driver playfully engaged in a snowball fight."
